<article class="env-remark" id="0FEM">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0FEM">Remark <span data-tag="0FEM">42.56.5</span>.</a> Let $(S, \delta )$ be as in Situation <a href="/tag/02QL" data-tag="02QL">42.7.1</a>. Let $X$ be locally of finite type over $S$. The Chern character map defines a canonical ring map </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  ch : K_0(\textit{Vect}(X)) \longrightarrow \prod \nolimits _{i \geq 0} A^ i(X) \otimes \mathbf{Q}  \]
</div>
  <p> by sending a generator $[\mathcal{E}]$ on the left hand side to $ch(\mathcal{E})$ and extending additively. This is well defined by Lemma <a href="/tag/0F9C" data-tag="0F9C">42.45.2</a> and a ring homomorphism by Lemma <a href="/tag/0F9D" data-tag="0F9D">42.45.3</a>. </p>
</article>